# 🎯 The biggest misunderstanding

When people read this job description they think:

> "I need to learn 30 different technologies."

Not true.

You're really learning just **7 core skills**:

| Learn This                | Why                                  |
| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| 🐍 Python                 | Write AI applications and automation |
| ☁️ AWS                    | Cloud where everything runs          |
| 🏗️ Terraform             | Build infrastructure automatically   |
| 🐳 Docker + Kubernetes    | Run applications reliably            |
| 🤖 Bedrock + RAG + Agents | Build GenAI features                 |
| 🚀 CI/CD                  | Deploy changes automatically         |
| 📊 Monitoring + Security  | Keep the platform healthy and secure |

